   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Ptmo CT: Apoyo Reforma Sector Financiero</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE TC PROGRAM IS COMPRISED OF TWO COMPONENTS: (1) SUPPORT TO THE LEGAL COMMISSION OF THE BCN FOR PREPARATION OF DRAFT LAWS RELATED TO THE LEGAL FRAMEWORK OF THE FINANCIAL SYSTEM, (2) SUPPORT TO THE SBIF FOR DEVELOPMENT OF INFORMATION SYSTEMS RELATED TO BANK PERFORMANCE REPORTING, AND DEVELOPMENT OF REGULATORY AND SUPERVISORY MECHANISMS FOR NON-BANK FINANCIAL INTERMEDIARIES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
